Package: bootmean
Title: Percentile Bootstrap Confidence Intervals for a Mean
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Silas", "Bambil", , "sbambil1@student.gsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yasmeen", "Babagana", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Constructs percentile bootstrap confidence intervals for a
    population mean using resampling with replacement. Returns the sample
    mean, interval endpoints, and bootstrap means, with checks for invalid
    inputs.
